## 1. Purpose

This package is the separate decision surface required after the frozen R3
offline closure. It can authorize at most one execution of the already frozen
R3 runner in `--actual` mode. It does not authorize any Host lifecycle,
plugin, runtime, worktree, checkout, payload delivery, implementation change,
Git delivery, or real-world effect.

