## 3. Exact future operation

Only this process is eligible, after the decision in Section 6A and no other
command or argument:

```text
env -i PATH=/usr/bin:/bin HOME=/nonexistent LC_ALL=C \
  /usr/bin/python3 \
  /home/jenn/AGENTS_OS_Workspace/control-plane/registry/run-phase-5d-m0d-actual-object-only-source-run-r3.py \
  --actual
