Working directory: `/home/jenn/AGENTS_OS_Workspace`.

The runner itself verifies all bound workspace bytes before compiling or
executing the scanner, uses `GIT_NO_REPLACE_OBJECTS=1`, and refuses a missing,
substituted, unsafe, or stale input. It must stop before any Git object command
when its admission sequence fails.

## 4. Success is deliberately narrow

Success can produce only a candidate-only receipt stating all of the following:

```yaml
result: OBJECT_ONLY_SOURCE_RUN_EVIDENCE_CANDIDATE_ONLY
Git_command_count: 24
allowlisted_blob_content_reads: 7
protected_blob_content_reads: 0
worktree_created: false
payload_materialized: false
Host_operation_count: 0
runtime_or_effect_operation_count: 0
