```

Neither success nor failure authorizes a Host call, plugin discovery/loading,
N-API, runtime, database, provider, authentication, private Memory,
state-private access, sensing, recording, or an effect.

## 5. Preconditions immediately before execution

Nobao must rehash every entry in Section 2, validate the preflight profile,
verify the exact future invocation has no extra argument, and verify both the
temporary run root and receipt target are absent. Any mismatch, preexisting
path, missing prerequisite, or unavailable observation is `BLOCKED` and no
Git command may run.

The operation must not proceed until the current Jenn decision in Section 6A
has been received verbatim or explicitly confirmed as the complete exact text.

